<title>CHINA: Trade in Liu Chong Hing Bank suspended.</title>
<headline>Trade in Liu Chong Hing Bank suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares Liu Chong Hing Bank Ltd was suspended on Thursday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>The company's shares were up HK$4.85, or 24.94 percent, at HK$24.30 at midday.</p>
<p>Liu Chong Hing Bank, controlled by Liu Chong Hing Investment Ltd, provides banking, financial and related services to commercial, industrial and individual customers.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
